 \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection by email\")\n\nShare this selection\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection by email\")\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection by email\")\n\nShare this selection\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns \"Share this selection by email\")","metadata":{"url":"https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns","ogUrl":"https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns","title":"Unregulated loan notes and mini-bonds: don't risk your savings on promises of high returns | FCA","og:url":"https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns","favicon":"https://www.fca.org.uk/themes/custom/fca/favicon.ico","og:type":"article","ogImage":"https://www.fca.org.uk/sites/default/files/media/images/fca_social_share.jpg","ogTitle":"Unregulated loan notes and mini-bonds: don't risk your savings on promises of high returns","cachedAt":"2026-09-21T08:24:22.025Z","language":"en-GB","og:image":"https://www.fca.org.uk/sites/default/files/media/images/fca_social_share.jpg","og:title":"Unregulated loan notes and mini-bonds: don't risk your savings on promises of high returns","scrapeId":"01a0c314-5026-73cf-893a-9005c3e77a92","viewport":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0","Generator":"Drupal 10 (https://www.drupal.org)","proxyUsed":"basic","sourceURL":"https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/unregulated-loan-notes-mini-bonds-dont-risk-savings-promises-high-returns","cacheState":"hit","ogSiteName":"FCA","statusCode":200,"contentType":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","creditsUsed":1,"description":"The FCA banned the marketing of speculative mini-bonds and loan notes to ordinary retail investors from 1 January 2021.","theme-color":["#fff","#6c1d45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-20T09:00:07+01:00","og:site_name":"FCA","twitter:card":"summary","twitter:site":"@TheFCA","msvalidate.01":"57E38F6BD7138599EBD7F7F4FF496957","ogDescription":"These high-risk investments should not usually be advertised widely to the public.","publishedTime":"2026-08-19T11:25:45+01:00","twitter:image":"https://www.fca.org.uk/sites/default/files/images/fca-logo-social-media.jpg","twitter:title":"Unregulated loan notes and mini-bonds: don't risk your savings on promises of high returns","funnelback:nid":"173131","og:description":"These high-risk investments should not usually be advertised widely to the public.","MobileOptimized":"width","funnelback:type":"Statements,Consumer news","og:updated_time":"2026-08-20T09:00:07+01:00","twitter:site:id":"169431716","HandheldFriendly":"true","concurrencyLimited":false,"twitter:description":"These high-risk investments should not usually be advertised widely to the public.","article:modified_time":"2026-08-20T09:00:07+01:00","article:published_time":"2026-08-19T11:25:45+01:00","funnelback:search-type":"main,foi,news","mobile-web-app-capable":"yes","funnelback:content-type":"News","funnelback:created-date":"19/08/2026","funnelback:modified-date":"20/08/2026","google-site-verification":"UMTpd8qXqUbCGtkijm3SkFV2lRJQM2lIIkMKmJg8jMk","funnelback:published-date":"2026/08/20","funnelback:published-year":"2026","funnelback:published-int-date":"20260820","funnelback:date-of-release-year":"2026","funnelback:historical-publication":"false","apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style":"black"}},"success":true},"pairedItem":{"item":2}},{"json":{"data":{"markdown":"We use cookies to improve your online experience. Some cookies are necessary to make the site work. We’d like to set additional cookies to understand how the website is used. These are optional. All cookie data is anonymised. View [cookies](https://www.fca.org.uk/privacy/our-use-cookies \"Our use of cookies\").\n\n- Functional\n\nThese cookies are necessary for the operation of the FCA.org.uk web site\n\n- Non-functional\n\nAccept analytics and campaign advertising cookies\n\n\nAccept additional cookiesReject additional cookies\n\n- [Growth](https://www.fca.org.uk/search-results?topic_tags=f.Tag%7CfcaSearchTag%3DGrowth&sort_by=dmetaZ)\n\n# FCA expands global presence with new attachés in India and UAE\n\nPress ReleasesFirst published: 17/08/2026Last updated: 17/08/2026\n\nThe FCA has announced Sabina Saini and Darine Obeid as the financial services attachés for India and the UAE.\n\nSabina will be based at the British Deputy High Commission in Mumbai and Darine will be based at the British Embassy in Abu Dhabi.\n\nThese appointments expand the FCA's global presence, joining a global network that includes the FCA's existing attachés in Washington DC, Brussels and Singapore, as well as the Asia-Pacific, supporting international co-operation, exports and investment into the UK.\n\nRuairí O’Connell OBE, director, international, said: 'Our new financial services attachés in India and the UAE will advance the UK's interests on financial services policy and help drive investment into our open market.\n\n'The FCA's global network is vital to delivering across all parts of the FCA strategy. Just as the UK is a global financial services centre, the FCA is a globally connected regulator and international leader in financial regulation. Our new presence will help us and our counterparts in India and the Gulf do even more together.'\n\nSabina started on 10 August 2026 and Darine is starting on 31 August 2026.\n\n## Sabina Saini biography\n\nPreviously a manager at the FCA, Sabina led work on the UK's critical third parties regime and broader operational risk and resilience policy.\n\nSabina has just under 20 years' experience across financial regulation, audit and banking, focused on prudential supervision and risk.\n\nBefore joining the FCA in 2024, she spent over 8 years at the Bank of England in roles spanning resolution policy, supervision and audit.\n\n## Darine Obeid biography\n\nDarine has spent more than a decade at the FCA, specialising in supervision across retail banking, wholesale banking and fintech.\n\nShe led high-profile engagement in financial crime, operational resilience, AI and customer outcomes.\n\n## Notes to editors\n\n1. To understand the role of the FCA as a global regulator, read the [FCA strategy 2025 to 2030](https://www.fca.org.uk/about/how-we-work \"FCA strategy 2025 to 2030\").\n2. Boosting exports and inward investment is a core FCA growth priority, outlined in the [FCA's letter to the Prime Minister](https://www.fca.org.uk/publication/correspondence/fca-letter-new-approach-support-growth.pdf \"FCA's letter to the Prime Minister\").\n3. On 11 February 2026, the FCA signed an [Exchange of Letters](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/statements/fca-exchanges-letters-cooperation-india-regulator-ifsca \"Exchange of Letters\") with the International Financial Services Centres Authority (IFSCA).\n\nWas this page useful?\n\nYes\n\nNo\n\nWhat can we do to improve pages like this?\n\nWhat did you find helpful?\n\nSubmit Feedback\n\nLeave this field blank\n\n[Print Page](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae/printable/print \"Print Page\")\n\n[Linkedin](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite?mini=true&url=https%3A//www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae&title=FCA%20expands%20global%20presence%20with%20new%20attach%C3%A9s%20in%20India%20and%20UAE&summary=&source=FCA \"Publish this post to LinkedIn\")\n\n[Twitter](https://twitter.com/share?url=https%3A//www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae&text=FCA%20expands%20global%20presence%20with%20new%20attach%C3%A9s%20in%20India%20and%20UAE&summary=&source=FCA \"Share this on Twitter\")\n\n[Share with Email](mailto:?Subject=FCA%20expands%20global%20presence%20with%20new%20attach%C3%A9s%20in%20India%20and%20UAE%20at%20FCA&Body=I%20saw%20this%20on%20the%20FCA%20website%20and%20thought%20you%20might%20be%20interested%20https%3A//www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share with Email\")\n\nShare page\n\n\n## [Media Centre](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae\\#relatedContentCollapse)\n\n[Press releases and contacts for journalists and other media](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/media-centre)\n\n[Sign up to receive daily and weekly news and publications email alerts](https://www.fca.org.uk/news-and-publications-email-alerts)\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection by email\")\n\nShare this selection\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection by email\")\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection by email\")\n\nShare this selection\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection by email\")\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on LinkedIn\")\n- [Share this selection by email](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection by email\")\n\nShare this selection\n\n- [Tweet](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Twitter\")\n- [Facebook](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-india-uae \"Share this selection on Facebook\")\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.fca.org.uk/news/press-releases/fca-expands-global-presence-new-attaches-i