:{"data":{"markdown":"[Skip to content](https://www.complianceweek.com/data-privacy/meta-reaches-18b-settlement-with-states-over-child-safety-violations/#main)\n\nMeta has agreed to pay up to $18 billion and overhaul teen safety features on Facebook and Instagram as part of a settlement with 47 states, the District of Columbia, and U.S. territories.\n\n* * *\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/www.complianceweek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/cwmembershi_484848-2.jpg?resize=780%2C278&ssl=1)\n\n[Learn More](https://www.complianceweek.com/membership/)\n\n[Already a member? Sign in to an existing account.](https://www.complianceweek.com/data-privacy/meta-reaches-18b-settlement-with-states-over-child-safety-violations/#signin_modal)\n\n[![Avatar photo](https://www.complianceweek.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cropped-IMG_2885-scaled-1-120x120.jpg)](https://www.complianceweek.com/author/oscarg/)\n\n## [Oscar GonzalezManaging Editor](https://www.complianceweek.com/author/oscarg/)\n\nOscar Gonzalez is the Managing Editor for Compliance Week. He previously worked at Gizmodo, CNET, CBS News Radio, TheStreet, and NBC.\n\nEmail: oscar.gonzalez@complianceweek.com\n\nLinkedIn: Follow [More by Oscar Gonzalez](https://www.complianceweek.com/author/oscarg/)\n\n## Sign in or register\n\nClose\n\nContinue with Google\n\nOr\n\nEnter the code sent to your email\n\nEmail address\n\nEnter your password\n\nSign in by entering the code we sent to , or clicking the magic link in the email.\n\nContinueResend codeEmail me a one-time code instead [Forgot password](https://www.complianceweek.com/my-account/lost-password/) Go back\n\n[Continue](https://www.complianceweek.com/data-privacy/meta-reaches-18b-settlement-with-states-over-child-safety-violations/#) [Set a password (optional)](https://www.complianceweek.com/data-privacy/meta-reaches-18b-settlement-with-states-over-child-safety-violations/#)\n\nWe'll send a verification code to **%EMAIL%**.\n\nSend code\nSkip for now\n\nLink\nCopy link\n\n[Toggle p