_Fails_To_Pass_US_Senate_As_Republicans_Turn_On_Crypto_Bill.php)\n- [8\\\\\n\\\\\nWorld Bank names Nobel laureate Michael Kremer as chief economist](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/World_Bank_Names_Nobel_Laureate_Michael_Kremer_As.php)\n- [9\\\\\n\\\\\nFCA seeking industry input on tokenising gold](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/FCA_seeking_industry_input_on_tokenising_gold.php)\n- [10\\\\\n\\\\\nKlarna launches in-app call verification feature to fight fraud](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/Klarna_Launches_Inapp_Call_Verification_Feature_To_Fight_Fraud.php)\n\n- [Expert Views](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/Visa_Updates_A2A_Protect_To_Prevent_Fraud_Before_Payments_Leave_Accounts.php#solid-justified-tabexpertviews)\n\n- [1\\\\\n\\\\\nFinance AI is about honesty, not personality](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/finance-ai-is-about-honesty-not-personality.php)\n- [2\\\\\n\\\\\nComplaint handling is the right place to put AI to work](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/expert-views-complaint-handling-is-the-right-place-to-put-ai-to-work.php)\n- [3\\\\\n\\\\\nShorten the path from financial statements to credit decisions – How AI is Closing the gap in commercial lending](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/shorten-the-path-from-financial-statements-to-credit-decisions.php)\n- [4\\\\\n\\\\\nBuild, buy or partner? Why the right AI strategy is the one built for your business](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/build-buy-or-partner-why-the-right-ai-strategy-is-the-one-built-for-your-business.php)\n- [5\\\\\n\\\\\nOpenAI Didn’t Fail at Checkout… Payments Did](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/expert-view-openai-didnt-fail-at-checkout-payments-did.php)\n- [6\\\\\n\\\\\nBuilding a Security First Culture in Retail Banking](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/expert-views-building-a-security-first-culture-in-retail-banking.php)\n- [7\\\\\n\\\\\nHow the CIO and CFO partnership has evolved in the digital age](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/how-the-financial-services-cio-and-cfo-partnership-has-evolved-in-the-digital-age.php)\n- [8\\\\\n\\\\\nBuilding the future of intelligent finance: Huawei’s vision for a digital financial ecosystem](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/huawei-building-the-future-of-intelligent-finance-expert-view.php)\n\nBeyond compliance: Building unshakeable operational resilience in financial services\n\nYour browser does not support HTML5 video.\n\nIn today's rapidly evolving financial landscape, operational resilience has become a critical focus for institutions worldwide. As regulatory requirements grow more complex and cyber threats, particularly ransomware, become increasingly sophisticated, financial services providers must adapt and strengthen their defences. The intersection of compliance, technology, and security presents both challenges and opportunities.\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/Finance-Ad-120x600-20260731.png)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/risk-resilience-and-the-modern-financial-workspace/)\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/120x600-FStechEvent-banner-17-08-2026.jpg)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.fstech.co.uk/fsi-leadership-forum-navigating-ai-sovereignty-and-the-next-era-of-banking/)\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/120x600-A-rackspace-keep-control-ai-0526.png)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/scaling-sovereign-ai-across-uk-financial-services/)\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/payments-awards-book-now-120X600-Book-0726.jpg)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.payments-awards.com/awards/booking_form.php)\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/120x600-FStechAI-Register-animated-0625.gif)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.fstech.co.uk/futureai-finserv/)\n\n[![](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/images/120x600_FStech_cyber_conf_2026-register-now-0625.gif)](https://www.fstech.co.uk/fst/link.php?url=%20https://www.fstech.co.uk/cybersecuritylive/)\n\n[![](http